# EyeOnPit 1.4.1 access-control patch.
# Temporary shared passcode gating the operational application (/app,
# /investigations, /settings, /help). Never committed with a real value —
# set the actual value in your local .env.local (gitignored) and in the
# Vercel project's Production environment variables.
EYEONPIT_APP_PASSCODE=

# EyeOnPit 1.6 Priority B9 — a SEPARATE temporary shared passcode gating the
# private /lab research area only. Deliberately independent from
# EYEONPIT_APP_PASSCODE above (a different env var, different cookie,
# different signing namespace — see lib/labAuth/session.ts). Never committed
# with a real value — set the actual value in your local .env.local
# (gitignored) and in the Vercel project's Production environment variables.
EYEONPIT_LAB_PASSCODE=
